<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark static-top">
        <ul class="navbar-nav">
            <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li>
            <li class="nav-item active"><a class="nav-link" href="/documentation">Documentation</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>
    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="mt-4">View and Refresh Containers</h1>
        <p><strong>Feature branch:</strong> <code>feature/docker-container-list</code></p>
        <p>Container Deck runs the Docker CLI, parses its output, and displays all local containers in a JavaFX table. The Refresh button reloads the current name, image, status, and state of each container.</p>
        <img src="/images/image1.png" class="img-fluid mb-4" alt="Container Deck table with no containers">
        <img src="/images/image2.png" class="img-fluid mb-4" alt="Container Deck table displaying a running container">
    </div>
